{'symbol': 'PM', 'date': '2022-11-25 13:05:00', 'title': 'PHILIP MORRIS INTERNATIONAL ANNOUNCES NEW REGIONAL STRUCTURE AND SENIOR MANAGEMENT CHANGES TO ACCELERATE GROWTH TOWARD A SMOKE-FREE FUTURE', 'text': 'LAUSANNE, SWITZERLAND--( BUSINESS WIRE )--PHILIP MORRIS INTERNATIONAL INC. (PMI) (NYSE: PM) TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEW REGIONAL STRUCTURE AND RELATED SENIOR MANAGEMENT CHANGES TO ENABLE CONTINUED GROWTH AS A MULTICATEGORY LEADER INTERNATIONALLY AND ADVANCE ITS RAPID TRANSITION TOWARD A SMOKE-FREE FUTURE.'}